# Load path for editors; the build itself goes through rocq/Makefile, which
# passes the same -Q flag.  It sits at the repository root because that is the
# directory a language server is started in, and Rocq searches upward from
# there.  GeoCoq and the standard library come from ROCQPATH, which the dev
# shell sets, so the editor has to be launched from `nix develop`.
-Q rocq/Ender Ender
